    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "接入状态与使用边界",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**待TEST Cloud指标名/标签校验。** OTel单位秒；模板采用标准Prometheus翻译（秒直方图_seconds_bucket、计数_total）。本机已验证SDK OTLP单位和安全字段、固定Alloy配置解析；不等于Cloud已摄取。这里是下钻，不替代计费事实。\n\n生成连接关闭不等于前端完整显示。phase=first_token的first_token_observed不等于完整成功；race_lost不算供应商失败；平台仅OpenRouter/Venice，不推断内部供应商。Prisma操作含排队，不是纯SQL或纯pool wait。"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "普通接口 P95（不含长连接生成）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
